  Fragment <verbatim|chapters/17-current-contraction.tex>,5pages standalone
  clean. Parent integrates; UV independently reviewed the complete
  triangular/current bounds and found no further mathematical correction
  after the output-link convolution and root-sign fixes. This supersedes the
  prior audit statement that pre-L bounds on nonlinear second/third
  stationary jets are necessary.

  <section|Exact quadratic channel><label|exact-quadratic-channel>

  Initial E2 symbol vanishes through total spatial momentumdegree3 by linear
  Maxwell stress divergence identity and normalized pathactionweight4. It
  satisfies Ward identity oneach independent inputmomentum. Under
  actualstationary pullback, nonprincipaltransversealias amplitude
  isO(p\<twosuperior\>) by KfN=A_lKc andfixednonzeroaliasinverse.
  K0=M\<twosuperior\>G hasdoublezero atnonprincipalanchoralias. Thus
  principal/principal, single nonprincipal, and double nonprincipalterms
  eachretainorder4. This holdsatfinitehistory, withactualtangent
  modulofinegauge.

  Two-independent-leg analyticcurl division preservesTaylororder,
  leavingtwoextradifferences afteronecurloneachleg. Allocation(1,3)/(2,2)
  costsL^-6 throughactualsmoothWa; K0hasboundedl1sum, notL4volume;
  currentengineeringL5 giveshomogeneousC_j/L.
  NoadditiveC/log\<twosuperior\>source. UVcheckedquadraticchannel.

  <section|Full triangular defect vector><label|full-triangular-defect-vector>

  Radialgauge substitutes the COMPLETE gauge-invariant defect first.
  RawD3/D4E needNOT satisfylinearWard separately. Itslinear
  stationarytangents in anchoredradialgauge costL^-2 timesfineanchor
  polynomial; diagonalr3/4 gainL^-1/L^-3.
  Nonlineargaugeandstationaryderivatives multiplylowerfieldderivatives only.

  Explicit differentiatedstationarity equations givez2,z3. Forestsliceinverse
  isPi_F C^-1 Pi_F*, withcommon-widthcompletedinverse from7
  andblocklocalforestprojection+dual. ProjectionnormsmaydependL
  butcoarsewidthdoesnotcollapse. Path/predictorvertices
  similarlyhavefixedcoarsewidth,C_j,Lnorm.
  Restrictstripsbyfixedfactorforintermediatemomentumsums. Hencebelowdiagonal
  constantsC_j,L finiteperioduniform; afterdivisionby(logbeta)^r
  multiply(logbetafine)^s/(logbetacoarse)^r\<rightarrow\>0 fors\<less\>r.
  Allowedchoiceorder isratiofirst,thenentry. This is sufficient, no
  uniformpreL nonlinearnormclaimed.

  Exactenvelope+penaltysimultaneousleftinvariance givesDSstat[Y']=L5 I K0
  DS[Y]. Rootcoarsegaugecorrection haszeroactionvariation.
  Newpathactionagreeswithstationaryactionthrough4;Y'(0)=0
  impliesitsvariationagreesalso through4. ThusE'=L5I K0Eexactatorders2\U4
  andrecursionhomogeneous. BoundedinitialWilsondefect
  contracts2^-depthatfixedoutput.

  <section|Accompanying currentbounds><label|accompanying-currentbounds>

  J2leadingweight4 fixedexactlybyprincipalN0=L^-1I,K_a mass1;
  allnonprincipalcontributionshigherdegree.

  IMPORTANTsign: ch5Q=M+d0,cR; sourceI R0
  atzero=R=\<tau\>0\<minus\>avg\<tau\>; source
  d_V\<varphi\>=\<varphi\>tail\<minus\>AdV\<varphi\>head
  hasd_V\|0=\<minus\>d0,c. ThusSOURCEPLUS R_f+d_VR0 atzero=M EXACTLY.
  FragmentnowdefinesR_f,R0,dVandY' withfineanchor sum explicitly. This
  killsroughroot-rowcontributions toequal-orderTaylorterms.

  M columnsum L^-3 followsboxaliaspartition+rowmassL andL4residues.
  LeadingfinecurvatureL^-2 andcurrentL5 preserveleadingYcurvature.
  Gaugecovariancefixesitsweight2quadraticcommutator. Ylinearremainder
  hasonecurldifference plusoneextra; ifextraonfield,Wa
  givesL^-1;ifonoutputlink,movedontoM rowdifference givesl1boundC
  ratherthanCL. This outputmomentcase wasaddedexplicitly. K0linftyL^-4
  \<times\>Mrowl1CL givesL^-3 localoutputnorm byconvolution over
  translatedcurrentsupport. Finepatchescoverboundednumbercoarseoutputedges;tailsweighted.

  Jremainderdiagonalr2gainsL^-1,r3/4L^-2/L^-4.
  YremainderlinearL^-1,r\<gtr\>=2L^(2\<minus\>2r).
  Allnonlinearcoefficientmapsmultiplylowercurrentjets,
  absorbedbylognormalization. FixedreferenceforcingC_j,L isdividedbypositive
  logpowersandmade\<less\>=1/4atentry.

  q/t primitiveoldtermsL3 gainL^(3\<minus\>2r)\<less\>=L^-1 since
  startfieldorder2. NewL4KtrJ termsareone-wayboundedforcingfromJ;
